Domain Analysis As shown in Table 2, prefer-
ences for GenUI vary by domain. Users strongly
favored GenUI in Data Analysis & Visualiza-
tion(93.8%) and Business Strategy & Operations
(87.5%), where tasks typically involve interpret-
ing large amounts of structured information. By
